","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD01.DX_GRD01_LK009118":{"duration":3.403,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Well THAT's a first. Nobody's ever escaped before!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD01.DX_GRD01_LK009120":{"duration":2.803,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ha! I would never have guessed.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD01.DX_GRD01_LK009122":{"duration":10.309,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Yeah -- and those other two Soundwave hangs out with? They may be small, but they're REALLY mean. Enjoy their work a little too much if you ask me.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD01.DX_GRD01_LK009126":{"duration":1.697,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The escapees! They're here!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Les fugitifs\u00a0! Ils sont ici\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD01.DX_GRD01_LK009477":{"duration":1.986,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Welcome to Kaon.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Bienvenue \u00e0 Kaon.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD01.DX_GRD01_LK009788":{"duration":0.803,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Guilty!","show":false}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Coupable\u00a0!","show":false}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009052":{"duration":1.424,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Move it, Autobots!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Avancez, Autobots\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009070":{"duration":1.047,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Keep moving!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009083":{"duration":3.491,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ready! Aim! Fire!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009085":{"duration":1.454,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Up against the wall!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009087":{"duration":0.68,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ready!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Pr\u00eat\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009089":{"duration":0.798,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Aim!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"En joue\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009091":{"duration":1.531,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"ARRRRGGHHH!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009105":{"duration":1.08,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There! Get him!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"L\u00e0\u00a0! Attrapez-le\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009107":{"duration":0.904,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Where are they?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009119":{"duration":3.446,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"They won't get far. Soundwave hates loose ends.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD02.DX_GRD02_LK009121":{"duration":9.876,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"He's kind of terrifying, if you ask me. Him AND Laserbeak. You see what they did to those Autobots yesterday? Scarred my optics, I'm telling you.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_GRD03.DX_GRD03_LK009082":{"duration":0.582,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Halt!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Halte\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_JTSA01.DX_JTSA01_LK000663":{"duration":0.896,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 1","show":false}]},"WL_DX_JTSA01.DX_JTSA01_LK000667":{"duration":2.528,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 5","show":false}]},"WL_DX_LSRBK.DX_LSRBK_LK009259":{"duration":2.069,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Kakaaaaw!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Kakaaaaw\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009479":{"duration":6.713,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Well. Look at this. The PRODIGY returns.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009482":{"duration":19.351,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I knew you couldn't resist rescuing Zeta Prime...which is why I orchestrated the entire thing. Zeta contacting you...your capture...all of it. All to bring YOU before ME.  Welcome to your defeat.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009488":{"duration":20.837,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Don't flatter yourself, Optimus. What I do, I do for ALL of Cybertron! My orbital station's Energon Bridge is back online...allowing me to create an infinite supply of Dark Energon. I shall use that power to return our planet to its former glory!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009491":{"duration":1.507,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"At ANY cost!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009495":{"duration":1.978,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I will save this planet!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Je vais sauver cette plan\u00e8te\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009499":{"duration":5.958,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You cannot defy destiny, Optimus!  I WILL bring order to Cybertron!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009503":{"duration":4.498,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Why do you continue this pointless struggle? You know I'm right!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009508":{"duration":21.435,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"OUR war, Optimus--a war that I am winning.  I've tamed the great Omega Supreme.  Zeta and the other Primes have fallen.  And yet YOU continue to resist the inevitable.  You have the power to end this conflict right now with one simple choice.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009511":{"duration":4.314,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Take your Autobots, and leave Cybertron forever.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009515":{"duration":3.89,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Or stay, and face complete annihilation.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009518":{"duration":6.282,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I was hoping you'd say that. It will make destroying you all the more satisfying!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009522":{"duration":8.589,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Enough of this. You're about to join Air Raid and the thousands of other Autobot fools as our prisoners. Permanently.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009648":{"duration":4.365,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Decepticons! Do NOT allow the Autobots to reach Zeta Prime!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Decepticons\u00a0! Les Autobots ne doivent PAS atteindre Zeta Prime\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009649":{"duration":3.324,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":" You will never leave this prison \nalive, Optimus!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009654":{"duration":1.799,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Destroy them, you fools!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009054":{"duration":3.044,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Have faith, Bumblebee--and follow my lead.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Aie confiance, Bumblebee... Et reste derri\u00e8re moi.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009072":{"duration":2.561,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Patience. Our time is near.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Patience. Encore un peu de patience.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009081":{"duration":4.847,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Energon Bridge.  It powers Megatron's orbital base.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Le pont d'\u00e9nergon. Il alimente la station orbitale de Megatron.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009094":{"duration":11.793,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Thank you, Air Raid. The plan is working perfectly. By allowing ourselves to be captured, we've gained access to the prison -- and now stand a much better chance of saving Zeta Prime.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009112":{"duration":9.891,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"It's too great a risk right now, unarmed as we are...but I promise, we'll come back for Air Raid as soon as possible. ...Let's get moving.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009115":{"duration":3.367,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hmm. We'll have to smash through these grates.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009116":{"duration":2.547,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"These grates look brittle enough to break through.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ces grilles ont l'air assez fragiles pour \u00eatre d\u00e9truites.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009123":{"duration":4.716,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ready your energy blades--we'll drop \ndown and surprise them!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009137":{"duration":2.549,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Quickly, Autobots! Take their weapons!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009139":{"duration":2.734,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Decepticon prison fields.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"La grande prison des Decepticons...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009155":{"duration":1.602,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Megatron.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Megatron\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009157":{"duration":5.848,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"THAT's what this is about? REVENGE for what happened so long ago?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009159":{"duration":2.221,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"At what cost, Megatron?","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Mais \u00e0 quel prix, Megatron\u00a0!?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009161":{"duration":3.91,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You offer a choice? ...I'm listening.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009163":{"duration":0.595,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Or?","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Sinon\u00a0?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009165":{"duration":8.945,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"This is our home, Megatron.  We will stay.  We will fight.  And we will win!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009173":{"duration":1.189,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Here they come!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009264":{"duration":3.34,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots -- NOW! Fire at Soundwave!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009266":{"duration":2.633,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Soundwave! Take THIS!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009270":{"duration":3.14,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hold on, Zeta.  We'll get you out of there!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009272":{"duration":3.191,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Zeta...let's bring him home.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009507":{"duration":6.956,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You're mad, Megatron! Your war is destroying the very planet you want to save!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009529":{"duration":3.898,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":" Megatron teleported us directly into \na prison cell.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009533":{"duration":5.299,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hmmm. Autobots -- I'm sensing faint energy emanations from that wall.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009535":{"duration":3.073,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Well then, Sideswipe...watch and learn.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009538":{"duration":3.084,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There is much you don't know about \nme, Sideswipe.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Tu as encore beaucoup \u00e0 apprendre sur moi, Sideswipe.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009545":{"duration":9.067,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"No, I'm afraid not. Doing that requires all of my reserve power, and takes a long time to recharge.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009547":{"duration":6.31,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Air Raid surveyed this prison \nthoroughly-when we find him, we \nfind our answer.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009551":{"duration":8.19,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Your freedom is near, my brothers \nBe patient--be strong--and be ready \nto fight.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009569":{"duration":2.826,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Air Raid -- where are the controls to your cell?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009573":{"duration":2.65,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":" Hold tight, Air Raid. We'll get you \nout.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009589":{"duration":1.776,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Good work, Autobots.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Beau travail, Autobots.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009591":{"duration":3.231,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":" We're not finished until EVERY Autobot \nhere is free.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Nous devons encore lib\u00e9rer TOUS les autres Autobots enferm\u00e9s ici.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009593":{"duration":1.487,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Lead the way, Air Raid.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009599":{"duration":1.443,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Even Zeta Prime's?","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"M\u00eame celle de Zeta\u00a0?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009603":{"duration":8.218,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Let's give the Decepticons something else to think about. Its time to \nfree our Autobot brothers. Who wants to do the honors?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009604":{"duration":4.63,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There. Freedom restored...and diversion created.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009618":{"duration":3.835,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":" Autobots! We must escort our brothers \nto safety!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009619":{"duration":2.44,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Provide cover fire for the escapees!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009620":{"duration":1.392,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Take out those sentries!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009625":{"duration":1.982,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Quickly! Head for the hangar!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009626":{"duration":6.828,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Air Raid -- make sure the prisoners get out safely, then escort them back to Iacon. We'll meet you there.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009628":{"duration":3.574,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":" We're not leaving without Zeta Prime. \nNow go!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009633":{"duration":2.918,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Now. Let's get who we came for.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009635":{"duration":3.226,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":" This wall crawler should carry us to \nthe lower levels.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009666":{"duration":1.919,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Pour on the speed, Autobots!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009692":{"duration":6.59,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The crawler's main servos still function. Now that it's been disarmed, we can use it for transport.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009696":{"duration":6.659,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Bumblebee... we're locked inside an enemy prison, surrounded by countless Decepticons bent on our destruction.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Bumblebee... Nous sommes enferm\u00e9s dans une prison et entour\u00e9s de milliers de Decepticons impatients de nous d\u00e9truire...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009698":{"duration":2.547,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"It's purely a matter of perspective.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009737":{"duration":2.729,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Brutes!  Flank 'em from behind!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009739":{"duration":3.441,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"My axe is fully recharged.  This way, Autobots!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009743":{"duration":3.437,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Decepticons will pay dearly for this.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Les Decepticons paieront cher cette infamie.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009744":{"duration":4.407,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That current looks strong.  Don't let it pull you into those grinders.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009747":{"duration":3.493,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The clamps are up.  Now to deactivate that shield.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009760":{"duration":2.297,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Focus your fire on the little one!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RUMBLE.DX_RUMBLE_LK009129":{"duration":3.6,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"First we crack the shell...then we crack the nuts inside","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RUMBLE.DX_RUMBLE_LK009131":{"duration":1.105,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That all you got?","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"C'est pitoyable\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RUMBLE.DX_RUMBLE_LK009132":{"duration":1.714,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Lucky shot!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RUMBLE.DX_RUMBLE_LK009257":{"duration":3.269,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Get ready to crumble...before RUMBLE!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RUMBLE.DX_RUMBLE_LK009528":{"duration":3.322,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Enjoy your stay, Autobots. Rust in peace.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009055":{"duration":6.688,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Optimus is right -- we've been in tougher spots than this. Wow...Megatron has gathered quite the army, hasn't he?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009068":{"duration":3.441,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Yeah? What exactly do you think \nthey're recycling?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009077":{"duration":2.304,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Um...are those...caskets?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009095":{"duration":2.385,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You certainly took your sweet time, Air Raid!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009111":{"duration":1.093,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Easy, Bumblebee.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009114":{"duration":1.924,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Air Raid said they were service ducts.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009125":{"duration":2.149,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Relax, Bee. We've got this.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009128":{"duration":2.799,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"NOW we're talking! I hate sneaking around!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009146":{"duration":2.807,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Keep your head down -- we've got snipers everywhere!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009149":{"duration":3.132,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Who cares?  Its shooting at us!  Shoot back!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009152":{"duration":1.53,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Eh -- I wasn't worried.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"J'\u00e9tais pas du tout inquiet\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009242":{"duration":1.535,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"What do they have him hooked up to?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009260":{"duration":2.505,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"These little guys are SO ANNOYING.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009263":{"duration":1.837,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ahhh, he's like their daddy!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ohhh, comme c'est touchant\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009487":{"duration":1.885,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Yeah? Neither are we!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009526":{"duration":2.767,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That lousy bucket of bolts CHEATED, that's what.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009534":{"duration":3.518,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"No offense, Optimus, but I don't see \nhow that's going to help.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009537":{"duration":1.387,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Didn't know you could do THAT!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Je savais pas que tu pouvais faire \u00c7A\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009546":{"duration":2.134,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There's gotta be a way to open these doors!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Il doit bien y avoir un moyen d'ouvrir ces portes\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009567":{"duration":5.02,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We took the extended tour, saw the sights, blasted some bad guys--the usual.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009574":{"duration":1.462,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hey -- what was that?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009580":{"duration":1.464,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Roger that, Ro-bro.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009582":{"duration":3.614,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Well, I can't just call you  Bee  all the time. That'd get boring!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Quoi, je peux pas t'appeler tout le temps Bumblebee. C'est lassant \u00e0 la fin\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009585":{"duration":2.068,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":" Can it, Air Raid, we're working,\nhere!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009594":{"duration":2.374,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You sure you know where you're going Air Raid?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009596":{"duration":0.974,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I'm just asking.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Qu'il est susceptible.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009622":{"duration":1.754,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We can funnel them to the side hangars!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009630":{"duration":2.766,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You ready for this, Bee? It's the big finale!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009637":{"duration":1.298,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Blast them! Blast them!!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009658":{"duration":2.434,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Reinforcements? I'm flattered!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009665":{"duration":1.683,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We'll make it! Keep driving!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009674":{"duration":2.63,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Shield your audio receptors!  Here it comes again!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009686":{"duration":1.795,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We can't blast through that shield!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Impossible de transpercer ce bouclier\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009690":{"duration":2.287,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"He's off the platform!  Now's our chance!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009699":{"duration":2.759,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Well, I'm lovin' this. Let's crack some heads!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009738":{"duration":4.168,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Looks like we got 'em all.  Of course--I got most of 'em.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009741":{"duration":2.442,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Must be how they recycle their prisoners.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"C'est comme \u00e7a qu'ils recyclent leurs prisonniers...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009759":{"duration":1.39,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Look out!  Seekers!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Attention\u00a0! Des Seekers\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009782":{"duration":2.492,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There!  Its working.  Down we go!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SIDSWP.DX_SIDSWP_LK009786":{"duration":4.163,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You'd think the Decepticons would have an easier way to unlock their cells.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009064":{"duration":1.963,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Initiate: processing.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009066":{"duration":1.515,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Take them to recycling.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Emmenez-les au recyclage.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009243":{"duration":2.773,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots. How...predictable.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots. Si... pr\u00e9visible.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009246":{"duration":5.275,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Rumble--eject!  Operation: Disorientation!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009247":{"duration":4.987,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Frenzy--eject!  Operation: Annihilation!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009248":{"duration":3.989,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Laserbeak--eject!  Operation: Divebomb!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009252":{"duration":2.24,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You cannot stop me, Autobots!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009265":{"duration":5.291,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Damage--substantial!  Must re-energize with Zeta's life stream!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009527":{"duration":3.456,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Autobots are secured. Escape is impossible.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009677":{"duration":1.728,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Rumble--return!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Rumble... retour\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009678":{"duration":1.941,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Frenzy--return!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK009680":{"duration":2.368,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Activate defense sentries!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Activation des syst\u00e8mes de d\u00e9fense\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK009271":{"duration":6.823,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"A noble sentiment, Optimus.  But I'm afraid, I am dead--already.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK009669":{"duration":2.558,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Optimus? Is that you?","show":true}]}}}
