t ascenseur devrait nous conduire jusqu'aux commandes des entraves d'Omega.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK003969":{"duration":2.625,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Great work! Just one more to go!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK003974":{"duration":2.687,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That did it! Let's get in there and help him out!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"\u00c7a y est, il est enfin libre\u00a0! Allons vite l'aider\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK003976":{"duration":3.737,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots! Defend Omega Supreme while he recovers!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK003978":{"duration":5.883,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We're glad you're free, Omega Supreme -- but I need you to open the Omega Gate immediately.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK003980":{"duration":3.902,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ratchet, do you copy? I need you here, double time!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004002":{"duration":3.301,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Energon! We can restore ourselves here.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"De l'\u00e9nergon\u00a0! Nous pouvons r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer un peu ici.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004004":{"duration":5.682,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Keep working, Ratchet -- but be aware, it looks as though the next wave is coming from the sky!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004007":{"duration":3.079,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Thank you, Omega Supreme. We'll take it from here.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Merci, Omega Supreme. C'est \u00e0 nous de jouer, maintenant.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004013":{"duration":3.583,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Thanks, Ratchet. We'll continue to the Core without you.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004014":{"duration":6.707,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Keep your optics sharp, Autobots. The High Council told me about the corruptive properties of Dark Energon.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004015":{"duration":5.726,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The closer we get to the core, the more dangerous and unstable Cybertron may appear.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004021":{"duration":6.519,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"They're a part of Cybertron's natural defenses. They'll eat away at the Dark Energon's corruption.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004025":{"duration":4.209,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We have nothing to fear, Autobots. The slugs will count us as friends.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004420":{"duration":4.949,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Core rests at the very center of Cybertron. We'll have to jump this to continue.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004425":{"duration":3.294,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The corruption is spreading more quickly than I had imagined.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"La corruption s'\u00e9tend encore plus vite que je ne l'avais imagin\u00e9\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004430":{"duration":1.219,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"What is it, Ironhide?","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Qu'y a-t-il, Ironhide\u00a0?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004442":{"duration":4.354,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I think they WANT us to ride them. They can sense we're here to help.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004451":{"duration":5.483,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"It makes sense for Megatron to have the Core so heavily protected. It's his most valuable asset.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004453":{"duration":5.319,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hrrgh. Autobots -- report your positions! Where are you?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004456":{"duration":3.734,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We need to regroup. Move forward, and stay in contact.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004457":{"duration":3.137,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ironhide, I can see you from my platform.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004459":{"duration":3.132,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hold on. I see a switch that might help.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004466":{"duration":5.253,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ironhide, I've encountered another flood gate. Do you see a control panel nearby?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004468":{"duration":2.872,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Now--let's find Warpath!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004473":{"duration":4.1,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We see you, Warpath, but we can't reach you. We'll try to find a way around.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004474":{"duration":5.06,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Warpath, we're at the shore of an energon river, but have no way of crossing it.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004476":{"duration":1.977,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That did it. Keep them coming.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"C'est bon\u00a0! Continue comme \u00e7a.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004477":{"duration":2.965,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Good work, Warpath. We're across now.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004482":{"duration":3.655,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Its leaving a trail of corruption wherever it goes.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004484":{"duration":2.7,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Let's get the last of those flood gates open.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004486":{"duration":4.931,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Look -- that's the outer shell of Cybertron's Core!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004490":{"duration":2.809,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"These are sacred grounds, Ironhide.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004491":{"duration":7.901,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Core provides energon and life to all of Cybertron. It pains me to see it defiled this way.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004492":{"duration":2.534,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The entrance to the core lies just ahead.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004496":{"duration":4.649,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There's no telling what we'll find in there. Gear up for anything.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004499":{"duration":3.74,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Don't waste any more time. We need to destroy the corruption and...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004501":{"duration":5.107,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"It's feeding off the Core's Dark Energon! Autobots -- take it out!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004505":{"duration":1.734,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Its armor is too thick!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Son armure est trop \u00e9paisse\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004508":{"duration":2.772,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Look -- it's drawing energy from the Core!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004510":{"duration":1.441,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Then keep hurting it!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004511":{"duration":1.894,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Give it everything you've got!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK004513":{"duration":3.546,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We did it. Nice job, Autobots.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK006015":{"duration":2.114,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We're wasting time.","show":false}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Assez perdu de temps\u00a0!","show":false}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK008024":{"duration":5.241,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"They won't give up that easily. Reload and power up before they come back.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK008025":{"duration":5.736,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That's another wave down...but gear up again. There'll be more coming.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK008026":{"duration":3.469,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ratchet, we can't keep this up forever. What's your status?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK008036":{"duration":3.173,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That--is a story for another time.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"\u00c7a... Nous en parlerons une autre fois.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK008040":{"duration":4.631,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Good idea, Warpath. Let's see how  fine  your aim really is.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009147":{"duration":3.623,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots -- take cover! Heavy weapons squad approaching!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009173":{"duration":1.189,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Here they come!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009675":{"duration":1.529,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Brace yourselves, Autobots!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009793":{"duration":2.393,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Be careful, Warpath, it may be a trap!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Attention, Warpath, c'est peut-\u00eatre un pi\u00e8ge.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009794":{"duration":3.654,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You heard him, Autobots!  Get these defenses online!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009799":{"duration":1.967,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You heard him! DIG IN!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Vous l'avez entendu\u00a0! COURAGE\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009804":{"duration":1.891,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Let ME give it a try.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009807":{"duration":5.956,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"My axe can't cut through this much corruption.  For now, we have other matters to deal with!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009816":{"duration":2.007,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Destroyer!  On the bridge!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_OPRIME.DX_OPRIME_LK009819":{"duration":7.526,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Whatever it is, its standing between us and saving Cybertron.  Autobots--Charge!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003942":{"duration":7.362,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Negative, Optimus. The system is too well-protected to hack...but if you can find a way to weaken their power grid, I might be able to get in.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"N\u00e9gatif, Optimus. Le syst\u00e8me est trop bien prot\u00e9g\u00e9 pour \u00eatre pirat\u00e9... mais si vous affaiblissez leur grille d'\u00e9nergie, j'ai peut-\u00eatre une chance.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003946":{"duration":6.496,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That did it -- I'm in. Hmm...the whole facility's in lockdown mode. Guess they know you're there, huh?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003948":{"duration":1.219,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I'll punch up a holo-map...","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"J'ai trouv\u00e9 une holo-carte...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003949":{"duration":5.278,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There. First thing you need to do is hack the Main Security Console. That'll cancel the lockdown.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003982":{"duration":3.391,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I'm on my way, Optimus, but it'll take me a few cycles to reach you!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Je suis d\u00e9j\u00e0 en route, Optimus, mais il va me falloir quelques cycles pour arriver\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003987":{"duration":1.098,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I'm here Optimus!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Je suis l\u00e0, Optimus\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003988":{"duration":2.743,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Keep those Decepticons off me while I patch him up, would you?","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Occupez-vous de ces Decepticons pendant que je le r\u00e9pare, d'accord\u00a0?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003990":{"duration":1.338,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Keep those 'cons off of me!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"\u00c9loignez-les de moi, enfin\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003991":{"duration":2.875,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots! I can't work when I'm getting shot at!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots\u00a0! J'ai du mal \u00e0 travailler quand on me tire dessus\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003992":{"duration":2.402,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hey, guys, I'm getting shot to pieces here!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003993":{"duration":1.799,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I'm taking some serious damage!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003994":{"duration":3.411,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Optimus! My systems are critical! I need assistance!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003995":{"duration":1.8,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"One more hit and I'm scrap metal!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK003999":{"duration":6.023,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"All right -- I've repaired Omega's vitals, but he still needs more work before he can finish opening the Omega Gate.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK004003":{"duration":4.396,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I've got Omega's primary capacitors restored, but I still need more time!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK004012":{"duration":3.32,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Optimus, I'll need to complete Omega's repairs at headquarters.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Optimus, je dois rentrer \u00e0 la base pour finir de r\u00e9parer Omega.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK009795":{"duration":2.856,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Those control panels should unlock the rocket turrets.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ces commandes devraient d\u00e9verrouiller les tourelles \u00e0 roquettes.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK009798":{"duration":4.903,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots--Omega is nearly battle ready.  Hold that Destroyer off just a little longer.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK009800":{"duration":2.699,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Almost there--just need a little more time...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_RTCHET.DX_RTCHET_LK009801":{"duration":1.349,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There! It's done!","show":tr