ing our city, Decepticon!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARA02.DX_CARA02_LK009345":{"duration":3.502,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Decepticons stop here! FOR ZETA PRIME!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARA02.DX_CARA02_LK009350":{"duration":5.584,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Must... fight...  Must warn... Zeta Prime...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK000658":{"duration":0.838,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 1","show":false}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK000659":{"duration":0.976,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 2","show":false}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK000660":{"duration":1.101,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 3","show":false}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK000661":{"duration":0.777,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 4","show":false}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK000662":{"duration":1.193,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 5","show":false}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK004180":{"duration":1.38,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Fall back!  Fall back!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Repliez-vous\u00a0! En arri\u00e8re\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK004985":{"duration":1.527,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Lord Megatron!  Help!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Seigneur Megatron\u00a0! \u00c0 l'aide\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK004986":{"duration":2.746,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hey -- I'm still functional! I'M STILL F--","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK009320":{"duration":3.264,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That Starscream guy is pretty cool.  Maybe he should be in charge...","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ce Starscream a vraiment du style. C'est peut-\u00eatre lui qui devrait commander...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK009334":{"duration":1.509,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Look! It's Megatron!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Regarde\u00a0! C'est Megatron\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK009336":{"duration":3.26,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Shut UP! You trying to get us both killed?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK009338":{"duration":1.882,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"AAAAAA!!!  I'm burning!!!","show":false}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK009339":{"duration":0.977,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Go!  Go!  Go!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Go\u00a0! Go\u00a0! Go\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK009341":{"duration":2.132,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hey, guys!  Looks like it's all clear!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD01.DX_CARD01_LK009342":{"duration":2.159,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"No WAY can we get past those turrets!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"On a AUCUNE chance de passer ces tourelles\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD02.DX_CARD02_LK009322":{"duration":2.076,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Don't let Megatron hear you say that!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD02.DX_CARD02_LK009335":{"duration":2.897,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"About time.  Why'd he show up so late?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CARD02.DX_CARD02_LK009343":{"duration":3.827,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hey, I'm good right here -- with my head OUT of the line of fire!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CYBTRN.DX_CYBTRN_LK009894":{"duration":1.875,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Initiating defense grid.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Initialisation des syst\u00e8mes de d\u00e9fense.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_CYBTRN.DX_CYBTRN_LK009895":{"duration":2.987,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Security measures deactivated.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Syst\u00e8mes de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9s.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_JTSA01.DX_JTSA01_LK000663":{"duration":0.896,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 1","show":false}]},"WL_DX_JTSD01.DX_JTSD01_LK000669":{"duration":1.778,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Death RX 2","show":false}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK000469":{"duration":7.9,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"While Starscream attacks Zeta Prime's armies head on, we shall move behind enemy lines and obtain the Omega Key.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK000471":{"duration":6.475,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Even the Autobots aren't foolish enough to leave the Stellar Galleries undefended. Destroy them!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK000475":{"duration":7.775,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I anticipated this. A powerful infusion of Dark Energon will bend the doors to my will!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK000476":{"duration":7.906,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Only the Autobots would build statues in honor of weaklings who fell in battle. Disgusting.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK000513":{"duration":12.595,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"It means the Autobots laze about and whine over their own inadequacies. Ugh...what a waste of time and resources. Decepticons! Find the Omega Key!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK000556":{"duration":2.003,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You heard him! Blast the wall!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Il fallait le dire\u00a0! Explosez ce mur\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK000983":{"duration":3.044,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Quickly! Infuse the batteries with Dark Energon!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK001049":{"duration":3.609,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"A simple solution, then.  Break the locks!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK001214":{"duration":3.35,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hahahahaha! For Glory!","show":false}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ha, ha, ha, ha\u00a0! Je suis le meilleur\u00a0!","show":false}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK002190":{"duration":10.283,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Once I have access to the core, I will infuse it with Dark Energon and subject the entire planet's energy supply to MY WILL!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK002339":{"duration":3.788,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Excellent work, Soundwave. Now unlock the exit door.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK002447":{"duration":6.216,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Excellent, Starscream. Continue engaging them so that I can acquire the Omega Key.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK002451":{"duration":1.886,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Soundwave. Damage report.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003150":{"duration":2.202,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"MOVE, Decepticons! Double-time!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"D\u00e9ployez-vous, Decepticons\u00a0! Ex\u00e9cution\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003151":{"duration":1.954,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Move to that exit! NOW!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Rejoignez cette sortie\u00a0! VITE\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003152":{"duration":1.364,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Blow open that door!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Faites sauter cette porte\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003511":{"duration":4.138,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Move forward and flank them!  Let nothing stand in my way!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003519":{"duration":9.818,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Oh, I trust Starscream about as far as I can blast him...but he shows a rare cunning that I find intriguing.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003521":{"duration":6.519,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Excellent! This venture has proven far less taxing than I had anticipated.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003523":{"duration":4.444,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Behold, Decepticons! The Omega Key!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003526":{"duration":6.424,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ah, Zeta Prime. I see you're still afraid to face me in person.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003528":{"duration":7.449,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"That is hardly a deterrent.  I will enjoy taking the Omega Key from your lifeless hands.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003539":{"duration":4.437,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Soundwave, trace Zeta Prime's broadcast signal.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003543":{"duration":3.301,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"This is the shortest distance to travel, Breakdown.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Je choisis toujours le chemin le plus court, Breakdown.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003544":{"duration":5.319,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Into the tunnel, Decepticons.  And try not to get crushed by the trains.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003546":{"duration":8.492,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Yes, Breakdown -- I am famous for my sparkling sense of humor. Now GET MOVING, before I dismantle you myself!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003550":{"duration":4.649,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There -- that station. From there we can infiltrate the lower levels of Iacon.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"L\u00e0\u00a0! Cette station\u00a0! De l\u00e0, on va pouvoir acc\u00e9der aux niveaux inf\u00e9rieurs de Iacon. ","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003553":{"duration":3.432,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Excellent!  The Omega Key awaits!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003555":{"duration":2.723,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Decepticons -- ready your weaponry for battle!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003558":{"duration":5.374,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Steady yourself, coward.  I marked this area for Dark Energon bombers.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003561":{"duration":6.521,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Perfect! Soon Iacon will be no more than a thick layer of rubble!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003565":{"duration":2.491,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Leave no Autobot alive!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003566":{"duration":1.497,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Blast those Aerialbots!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003568":{"duration":1.489,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Move out, Decepticons!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003569":{"duration":3.993,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Stay on the tracks -- if you want to get smashed to pieces!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003575":{"duration":4.283,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Excellent!  Brawl is already near the Omega Key!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003578":{"duration":4.362,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"If he dies, he's not worthy of the name Decepticon.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003582":{"duration":4.851,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Let us speak with Brawl, then.  I want to hear how my war is going.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003589":{"duration":3.584,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Witness the power of Dark Energon!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003591":{"duration":2.97,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Brawl, call in the Dark Energon bombers!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003593":{"duration":2.224,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"DO AS I HAVE ORDERED, BRAWL!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"FAIS CE QUE JE DIS, BRAWL\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003597":{"duration":3.185,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Silence!  Obviously our bombers are incompetent!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003599":{"duration":3.8,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"An excellent thought, Brawl. Carry it out.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003602":{"duration":4.998,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"No one turns back!  Destroy those guns by ANY means necessary!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003605":{"duration":3.026,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Split up and flank him!  Use the debris for cover!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003608":{"duration":3.593,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Onward, Decepticons.  Into the Vaults!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003611":{"duration":2.16,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There!  The gun controls.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Les commandes du canon sont l\u00e0\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003614":{"duration":1.494,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Move, Decepticons!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"\u00c9vacuez, Decepticons\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003618":{"duration":2.379,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Brawl -- call in the bombers.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003621":{"duration":4.464,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I see. When did they become YOUR ships, Starscream?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003625":{"duration":6.543,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I shall make you pay for this, Starscream. Decepticons -- hold your positions until the bombers arrive!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003629":{"duration":3.898,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Agreed, Brawl. Everyone hold fast and stay alert.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003631":{"duration":4.157,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Stop your whining, Breakdown, or I'll stop it for you.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003634":{"duration":5.917,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"WE HOLD THEM OFF. The bombers will clear the street when they arrive! Rely on that!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003640":{"duration":6.288,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Good. Brawl -- remain here and hold this position. The rest of us will move forward and acquire the Omega Key!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Parfait. Brawl, reste ici et tiens cette position. Je vais continuer d'avancer avec les autres et r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer la cl\u00e9 Omega\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003642":{"duration":2.808,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobot Aerialbots!  Swat them out of the sky!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003654":{"duration":5.002,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Autobots think they can snipe us from the bridge!  Show them their error!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003657":{"duration":2.275,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"DESTROY THESE AUTOBOT WEAKLINGS!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003668":{"duration":3.68,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Your pathetic machinery won't stop me, Zeta Prime!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003671":{"duration":4.611,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Finally!  The Omega Key is within my -","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003673":{"duration":4.012,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Come down HERE, Zeta Prime, and I will give you the answer!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003680":{"duration":3.432,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Your theatrics don't frighten me, Zeta.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003682":{"duration":7.899,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Is that all, Zeta?  A pathetic army of energon clones?  Is that the best you can do?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003689":{"duration":2.468,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"More Zeta clones!  Destroy them!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003692":{"duration":2.122,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"He's recharging.  Fire at the core!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003696":{"duration":3.44,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Stay off the glowing floors if you wish to live!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003700":{"duration":5.029,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Your machine is failing, Zeta Prime.  Where are your boasts now?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK003706":{"duration":5.639,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Endless duplicates of ZetaPrime - how nauseating!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004042":{"duration":5.671,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Descend here. And have a care -- one wrong step, and you're scrap metal.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004043":{"duration":1.307,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Impossible!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Impossible\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004182":{"duration":3.303,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Decepticons -- target the fuel cell on the back of the tank!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004195":{"duration":3.508,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We've breached its armor! Now DESTROY IT!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004198":{"duration":3.387,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"He's weakening, Decepticons!  Tear him apart!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Il commence \u00e0 s'affaiblir\u00a0! Achevez-le, Decepticons\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004204":{"duration":3.339,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Quit wasting firepower! You can't penetrate his shield!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"\u00c9conomisez vos forces\u00a0! On ne peut pas transpercer son bouclier\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004801":{"duration":0.472,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"What?!?","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Comment\u00a0!?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004973":{"duration":4.493,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Starscream - continue forward and meet Zeta Prime's armies on the front line!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004974":{"duration":1.551,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Do not fail me!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Je l'esp\u00e8re pour toi\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004980":{"duration":5.014,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Autobots are here, no doubt skulking in the shadows.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004981":{"duration":3.245,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Return fire!  Destroy anything that moves!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004983":{"duration":2.846,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Idiot. Decepticons! Onward!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK004984":{"duration":3.49,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"We need energon!  Break open the batteries on the walls!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"On a besoin d'\u00e9nergon\u00a0! D\u00e9truisez les batteries accroch\u00e9es aux murs\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK005177":{"duration":3.635,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Your mines inspire no fear in ME, Autobots!","show":false}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK005983":{"duration":2.547,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I laugh at your pitiful attempts to harm me!","show":false}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK008944":{"duration":1.718,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Onward!  Through that door!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK008952":{"duration":1.177,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"What are you waiting for?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009326":{"duration":1.851,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hurry!  Destroy the batteries!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009330":{"duration":2.323,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Don't get hit by the train, you fool!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009354":{"duration":2.833,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Soundwave, move quickly or Zeta will crush you!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK009355":{"duration":2.685,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Breakdown, you fool!  MOVE!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK010752":{"duration":2.194,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"A fine display of marksmanship.","show":false}]},"WL_DX_MGTRON.DX_MGTRON_LK010991":{"duration":2.957,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Now...time for more strategic slaughter!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Et maintenant, le carnage peut reprendre\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK000474":{"duration":3.435,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Megatron, the gate to the Stellar Galleries is locked.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK000511":{"duration":4.331,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Autobots maintain these rooms for tranquil contemplation.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK000555":{"duration":5.675,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Scans reveal poor structural integrity surrounding this maintenance access door.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK000982":{"duration":3.285,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Megatron -- those batteries feed the security grid.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Megatron\u00a0! Ces batteries alimentent leur grille d\u00e9fensive.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK002452":{"duration":2.411,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Scans show minimal damage.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_SNDWAV.DX_SNDWAV_LK003509":{"duration":4.267,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The Omega Key grants access to the 