atron -- the Dark Energon is proving every bit as formidable as you predicted! The Autobot armies crumble before it!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_STSCRM.DX_STSCRM_LK003620":{"duration":7.952,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Brawl, this is Starscream!  Your request is denied.  I won't have you wasting more of my ships!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_STSCRM.DX_STSCRM_LK003622":{"duration":5.152,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Oh -- Lord Megatron! I didn't realize YOU were there!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_STSCRM.DX_STSCRM_LK003623":{"duration":8.708,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Air support request approved -- but it will be a few cycles before the bombers can reach you. I'm afraid you'll just have to be patient.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_STSCRM.DX_STSCRM_LK004991":{"duration":6.771,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Have no fear, Lord Megatron! Under my leadership, Decepticon victory is assured!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_TKSA01.DX_TKSA01_LK004179":{"duration":3.4,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Engaging Decepticons at the Iacon Vaults.","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"\u00c9limination des Decepticons engag\u00e9e.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003525":{"duration":6.649,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Megatron, I'm warning you right now. You are toying with forces beyond your understanding or control.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003527":{"duration":9.112,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ha! Predictable as ever, right down to the empty words. The Omega Key is under MY protection now, Megatron.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003665":{"duration":3.457,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"You cannot hope to overcome my defenses, Megatron!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Tu n'as aucune chance de surmonter mes d\u00e9fenses, Megatron\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003672":{"duration":3.001,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Did you really think it would be that easy?","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Tu croyais vraiment que ce serait aussi simple\u00a0?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003674":{"duration":6.645,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I shall remain where I am -- this vantage point will provide an excellent view of your destruction.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003679":{"duration":4.984,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Do you see now, Megatron?  This is my domain.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003681":{"duration":4.499,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Here, I have the power to control...and create...","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003683":{"duration":7.471,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"HAHAHAHA! You have NO idea! Here, I have limitless power!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003685":{"duration":8.339,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"My will controls this entire chamber, Megatron. I need only close my hand to crush the life out of you!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003688":{"duration":5.792,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I can easily create more energon clones! You WILL be destroyed!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003695":{"duration":5.073,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"In this chamber, MY will reigns supreme, Megatron!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003699":{"duration":7.08,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"A valiant attempt, Decepticons, but Autobot machinery is more resilient than you realize.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003701":{"duration":5.529,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"The battle is far from over, Decepticon!  Prepare for destruction!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003702":{"duration":3.966,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"No! Systems failing...this cannot be!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003703":{"duration":2.971,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"It's only a matter of time before you're overwhelmed!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Votre \u00e9nergie finira par s'\u00e9puiser, c'est in\u00e9vitable\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003704":{"duration":3.406,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"There is nowhere to run, Decepticons.","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK003705":{"duration":3.148,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Do you see how futile your struggle is, Megatron?","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK004203":{"duration":3.144,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ha! Your weapons are useless against me!","show":true}],"fra":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Ah\u00a0! Vos armes sont sans effet sur moi\u00a0!","show":true}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK006920":{"duration":1.061,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hit RX 1","show":false}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK006921":{"duration":0.468,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hit RX 2","show":false}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK006922":{"duration":0.671,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hit RX 3","show":false}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK006923":{"duration":0.585,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hit RX 4","show":false}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK006924":{"duration":1.026,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Hit RX 5","show":false}]},"WL_DX_ZPRIME.DX_ZPRIME_LK010992":{"duration":10.383,"int":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Autobots, this is Zeta Prime.  Any Decepticon activity must be reported immediately, and all Decepticons are to be shot on sight! Zeta Prime out!","show":false}]}}}
